[I] A GSettings editor for GNOME

[T] Dconf Editor is a tool to allow direct editing of the dconf
[T] configuration database used by GSettings. It lets users browse the keys
[T] of installed applications, read their descriptions and edit their
[T] values, which is useful when developing applications using these
[T] settings.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/dconf-editor

[A] The GNOME Project
